      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel crushed, and it's a painful lesson in how the world doesn't always reward integrity. What you experienced is the harsh reality that sometimes, the system is designed to protect itself, and standing up against it is incredibly costly. Please don't let this one devastating experience convince you that the effort is pointless; instead, consider what you can do to build a new, more resilient foundation for yourself.",
