      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is valid, and it's a natural response to fighting a tide that feels too powerful to overcome. That energy you poured into fighting for what was right was not wasted; it was a demonstration of your own inherent worth, even if the external world couldn't recognize it. Right now, the only thing that matters is finding a way to stop the grinding, and that might mean stepping away from the fight entirely to simply rest.",
