      "content": "\"stepping away\" sounds like a fantasy. i'm not talking about just taking a vacation or a break from work. i mean everything feels so heavy and meaningless that i don't even see a way back to being a person in this society anymore. it's like there's no room for someone like me to actually exist without being destroyed. sometimes i feel like the only way to truly stop the grinding is to just... not be part of it anymore. like, to just exit the whole thing.",
